  "description": [
    "A carboxylic ester resulting from the formal condensation of the carboxy group of <em>N</em>-formyl-<small>L</small>-leucine with the hydroxy group of (3<i>S</i>,4<i>S</i>)-3-hexyl-4-[(2<i>S</i>)-2-hydroxytridecyl]oxetan-2-one. A pancreatic lipase inhibitor, it is used as an anti-obesity drug."
  ],
